--- !u!114 &1159145651
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1159145649}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9913fec5ac2c04c4283a443caab34cd3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SignalLost.DialogueSource
  speaker: Dr. Reyes
  prompt: Talk to Dr. Reyes
  lines:
  - You made it... good. OVERSEER took over the drones and robot guards after the
    lightning strike. It thinks we're intruders.
  - It also started a Purge Protocol. In twenty minutes the defense grid fires on
    everything left on this island.
  - The radio tower can call a rescue boat, but it needs three override fuses. Two
    are in the underground utility wings, one at the tower.
  - My leg's broken, so it has to be you. The armory has the Arc Pistol, but it's
    keypad-locked and I never learned the code.
  - "The technicians kept it in the old maintenance bunker, far to the northwest
    \u2013 follow the dirt path. They never wrote codes down plainly, so look carefully.
    No bots patrol out there."
  repeatLines:
  - The armory code is somewhere in the maintenance bunker to the northwest. Once
    you've worked it out, use the keypad by the armory door.
  persistentId: Briefing
  objectiveOnFinish: Find the armory code in the maintenance bunker northwest of
    the safe room
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
